          "field": "summary",
          "value": "You have just moved into a new house and you are experiencing some horrible nightmares. The nightmares are caused by the Aliens that made the \"dark world\" which the only access to is through the magic mirror. You've got to find whats behind those nightmares and get rid of the Aliens.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Acabas de mudarte a una nueva casa y estás sufriendo unas pesadillas horribles. Las pesadillas las causan los alienígenas que crearon el «mundo oscuro», al que solo se puede acceder a través de un espejo mágico. Tienes que descubrir qué hay detrás de esas pesadillas y deshacerte de los alienígenas.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
